description	"The Commander

The Commander functions as a cross-breed of the hero and officer classes. It carries the skills comperable to that of a Hero, and the Rally and support function to that of an officer. He can also provide much needed ammunition and tactical information via a Radar which reveals enemy positions. 

^2Weaponry:
- Blaster Pistol (3)
- Blaster Rifle (3)

^6Equipment: 
- Electrobinoculars
- Seeker Droid

^5Powers:
- Team Heal (1)

^8Attributes:
- Radar Scanner [Perma Sense 1]
- Strength (1)
- Heal (3)
- Rally - Characters with Assemble spawn on you
- CTF: 30s Respawn

^3Abilities:
- Ammunition supplies [Press Use to Drop Ammo]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Gun Kick ^3[CS3]

^2Strengths^7: The strongest of the rallying classes, can function both as support while still being individually strong. 
^1Weaknesses^7: Lacks any long range weaponry."